        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A disease that is the consequence of the presence of pathogenic microbial agents, including pathogenic viruses, pathogenic bacteria, fungi, protozoa, multicellular parasites, and aberrant proteins known as prions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
